      <p>Aged Care Legislation Amendment (Emergency Leave) Act 2020</p>
      <p>No. 41, 2020</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law in relation to leave from residential care services, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-1">Part 1</ref>—Amendments	3</p>
